  <Properties>
    <blockList>
      <Value><![CDATA[{
  "contentData": [
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "1e842305-259d-4448-b804-168859f39623",
      "key": "4c188fee-0236-4bee-b965-b378457d03c2",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "text",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EPlease pass the attached flyer and below message to teams and players in your league.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u00A0\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAre you a bit stuck, doing the same old knock-about practice sessions?\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u00A0\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWould you like some practical ideas for making your training sessions more fun and engaging?\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u00A0\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeed some help with how to develop your new players? Bring them along, they\u2019ll love it!\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u00A0\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMaybe you\u2019re thinking of setting up a junior session and don\u2019t know where to start.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u00A0\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECome and join our fun practical game ideas afternoon for clubs who want to explore new ideas for their stoolball sessions.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENo coaching experience needed, just a willingness to try something different.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u00A0\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFree to affiliated clubs or \u00A310 per person. Numbers are limited so please register beforehand by email to\u00A0\u003Ca rel=\u0022nofollow noopener noreferrer noreferrer\u0022 href=\u0022mailto:inf@stoolball.org.uk\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003Einf@stoolball.org.uk\u003C/a\u003E\u00A0or message Wendy Heal on 07724 867620.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u00A0\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESunday 15th\u00A0May 2pm \u2013 4pm.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKing George V Playing Field, Allington Road, Newick, BN84NA\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u00A0\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPLEASE REGISTER ASAP AS NUMBERS ARE LIMITED\u003C/p\u003E"
          }
        },
        {
